EXPERIMENT - 2
SECRET DATA EMBEDDING USING XIAO STEGANOGRAPHY
==================================================

AIM

To study the process of embedding and retrieving secret data using the steganography tool Xiao Steganography, and evaluate its effectiveness in concealing information inside image files.

DESCRIPTION

Steganography is the practice of hiding secret data within ordinary files to avoid detection.

Xiao Steganography is a software utility that enables users to hide text or file data inside BMP images or WAV audio files using encryption. Unlike cryptography, which focuses on scrambling data, steganography emphasizes disguising its existence altogether.

This experiment uses Xiao Steganography to embed a text file into a BMP image and then extract it, demonstrating how covert data transmission can work in practice.

PROCEDURE

1. Install Xiao Steganography

   1. Download Xiao Steganography from Softpedia.
   2. Install and launch the application.

2. Select Cover File

   1. Choose a BMP image file that will act as the carrier of hidden data.

3. Prepare Secret File

   1. Create a simple text file named message.txt containing the message you want to hide.

4. Embed the Secret File

   1. In Xiao Steganography, select the BMP image as the cover file.
   2. Choose the message.txt file as the hidden file.
   3. Select an encryption algorithm (e.g., RC2, TripleDES).
   4. Enter a secure password to protect the hidden data.
   5. Save the output as a new stego-image file.

5. Verify Stego Image

   1. Open the stego-image in a standard image viewer to confirm it appears unchanged.

6. Extract the Hidden File

   1. Open Xiao Steganography and load the stego-image.
   2. Enter the correct password and extract the message.txt file.
   3. Verify its contents.

OBSERVATION

Action                            Result

Image before embedding            Normal BMP image

Image after embedding             Visually unchanged

File extraction with password     Hidden file successfully retrieved

File extraction without password  Extraction failed due to encryption

• File size of the stego-image slightly increases due to embedded data.
• Visual inspection alone cannot detect hidden content.

RESULT

The experiment successfully demonstrates how steganography using Xiao Steganography can hide and securely retrieve a secret file within an image. The process ensures that the carrier file remains visually unaltered while protecting the concealed data using encryption.


